Gal 4:1 , We were under the law till Christ came, as the heir is under the guardian till he be of age;
Gal 4:5 , But Christ freed us from the law;
Gal 4:7 , therefore we are servants no longer to it;
Gal 4:14 , He remembers their good will to him, and his to them;
Gal 4:22 , and shows that we are the sons of Abraham by the freewoman.
